  "mathematics": [
    "No-root test is equivalent to irreducibility for a cubic over a field. Literal successive3x3 powers133,7,19 prove exact order133.",
    "A nonzero row annihilated by irreducible f has cyclic module F11[X]/f, so authentic abc has order divisible133. The nine-image direct expansion computes exactly vf(abc).",
    "For row action, common involution eigenlines correspond to the eight stacked transpose sign systems. Full rank7 excludes every rational LEFT line.",
    "Forward normalized-pivot elimination preserves span. Existing basis pivots remain ordered; copies are used for each extension, so common-prefix caching changes no rank.",
    "The conditional maximal-cover/line-geometry/J1-spectrum argument then gives LEFT=G and a nontrivial intersection with the omitted involution. It proves IP failure, not nongeneration."
  ],
  "new_case_Original_Lean_conjecture_measurement_credit": 0,
  "original_join_review": [
    "Full local domain is byte-identical to the accepted indexed original domain,509700B/cddb25c3. Matrix and field arrays were not decoded.",
    "All42 scalar (position,J-index,carried-matrix-SHA-label) triples independently match genuine accepted consumer proof metadata. Supplied field rows/cubic coefficients await actual verifier execution.",
    "Source checks exact orbit row at original position, representative membership and typed member/transporter roles; entire orbit-action proof remains an explicit imported premise.",
    "Both8x8 frame inverse products, all three original prefix transports in(a,e,b)order and missing c reconstruction via the literal public from_pair are executed by the future verifier, with full carried-matrix equality/hash.",
    "All cases must have the identical literal a,b,e prefix before reusing prefix sign bases. String commutations, strict normalized matrices and four distinct nonidentity involutions are checked."
  ],
